  id: spell-bless
  displayName: Bless
  description: You bless up to three creatures of your choice within range. Whenever a target makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to the attack roll or saving throw. Concentration, up to 1 minute. Modeled as a permanently granted FeatureDefinition (feature-bless) with a flat +2 approximation of the 1d4 bonus, applied to AttackBonus and every SavingThrow:<stat> query key, since there's no auto-expiring buff mechanism or rollable-modifier support yet -- see header comment.
